{
  "title": "Tropical Heat",
  "about": "Heat haze and chromatic aberration over flowing domain-warped noise in hot magenta, orange, amber and teal, with blooms of vivid colour (after Radiant's Tropical Heat by Paul Bakaus). The blooms flare on the kick and the heat can follow the track's energy. Heavy on the GPU: lower Octaves or turn Chromatic off if the projector stutters.",
